# STIG RHEL-09-231040: systemd autofs.service
# STIG ID: V-257849 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-231040-autofs-service-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-231040: RHEL 9 file system automount function must be disabled unless required.`
    description `RHEL 9 file system automount function must be disabled unless required.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig,service,systemd`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-231040,NIST-800-53:IA-3`
    control_objective `IA-3`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Rocky9:localhost:os-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for RHEL-09-231040.`

    component_id `comp-r9-os`

    impl_IA_3 `This control is validated by checking the required system configuration against the DISA STIG baseline for RHEL 9.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT svc_check
        unit_name `autofs.service`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE svc_state
        found boolean = true
        enabled string = `disabled`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN systemd_service
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF svc_state
            OBJECT_REF svc_check
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
